Haybarn
=======

Haybarn is an independent derived distribution of DuckDB, published by
Query Farm LLC. It is built from the DuckDB source code.

Haybarn is NOT affiliated with, sponsored by, maintained by, or endorsed by the
DuckDB Foundation or DuckDB Labs.

DuckDB is a trademark of the DuckDB Foundation. The name "DuckDB" is used here
only descriptively, to identify the upstream project Haybarn is derived from
("powered by DuckDB"). No DuckDB logo or other DuckDB trademark is used in
Haybarn's branding or artifacts.


